{"4515410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Phasebreak", "steam_appid": 4515410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phasebreak is a turn based tactics game where you go on the heist of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team has managed to get their hands on a warp device- But is that enough for them to get out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/extras/98234681ce52c2d0cc136e2269089688.poster.avif?t=1780646658\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/extras/98234681ce52c2d0cc136e2269089688.webm?t=1780646658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/extras/98234681ce52c2d0cc136e2269089688.mp4?t=1780646658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play grid based shootouts on two boards at once, warping both your crew and enemies to get a tactical advantages! What happens if you teleport someone into a wall? Only one way to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/extras/3310a2a0e869c13ba3088a26e305164a.avif?t=1780646658\" width=589 height=115 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Cast:</strong> Each crew member has their own kit to experiment with, and a loveable personality brought to life by Full Voice Acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live recorded soundtrack:</strong> Our soundtrack was live recorded by the award winning Nieuwe Veste Big Band and written by composers from the International School of The Hague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and Sweet:</strong> 2 levels filled with foes to beat spread across 2 dimensions each! And a mysterious foe waiting in the final room...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Experimentation:</strong> Feel confident trying stuff as you can fully rewind every action all the way back to the start of your turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment:</strong> Fight your way through a gambling den in Space, with destructible cover and unique set dressing for each dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a student game &lt;3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by over 29 students at the Breda University of Applied Sciences, with the wonderful help from the outsourcing we’ve received for music, voice acting and sound effects audio, this has been an amazing learning experience for us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be kind, and please have fun</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phasebreak is a turn based tactics game where you go on the heist of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team has managed to get their hands on a warp device- But is that enough for them to get out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/extras/98234681ce52c2d0cc136e2269089688.poster.avif?t=1780646658\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/extras/98234681ce52c2d0cc136e2269089688.webm?t=1780646658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/extras/98234681ce52c2d0cc136e2269089688.mp4?t=1780646658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play grid based shootouts on two boards at once, warping both your crew and enemies to get a tactical advantages! What happens if you teleport someone into a wall? Only one way to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/extras/3310a2a0e869c13ba3088a26e305164a.avif?t=1780646658\" width=589 height=115 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Cast:</strong> Each crew member has their own kit to experiment with, and a loveable personality brought to life by Full Voice Acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live recorded soundtrack:</strong> Our soundtrack was live recorded by the award winning Nieuwe Veste Big Band and written by composers from the International School of The Hague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and Sweet:</strong> 2 levels filled with foes to beat spread across 2 dimensions each! And a mysterious foe waiting in the final room...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Experimentation:</strong> Feel confident trying stuff as you can fully rewind every action all the way back to the start of your turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment:</strong> Fight your way through a gambling den in Space, with destructible cover and unique set dressing for each dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a student game &lt;3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by over 29 students at the Breda University of Applied Sciences, with the wonderful help from the outsourcing we’ve received for music, voice acting and sound effects audio, this has been an amazing learning experience for us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be kind, and please have fun</p>", "short_description": "In this turn based strategy game, your tactics are pushed to the limit as you need to consider not one,- but two gameboards. Warp both friend and foe between them, master interdimensional gunfights, and confidently strategize around RNG-free abilities in this FREE student project!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/720a08bc4ae967d516410c5fd7b6d15bde2c5fdf/header.jpg?t=1780646658", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/d67bbf7cc56bdf3a3c7bdb98124f441a0e0de53a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780646658", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515410/d67bbf7cc56bdf3a3c7bdb98124f441a0e0de53a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780646658", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070 8GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core  i7-8700K/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum